[en.FOCUS_C08_INDUSTRIAL_PLAN_1003]
Industrial Plan 1003

[en.FOCUS_C08_INDUSTRIAL_PLAN_1003_desc]
What do we have now? Factories that are attacked every day, severe shortages of military supplies, and barren resources...\n\nThis is unacceptable. Under such conditions, how can we even afford to talk about liberation? Sugar Belle, Head of Economy, will formulate an industrial plan to save our unsustainable industry.

[zh.FOCUS_C08_INDUSTRIAL_PLAN_1003]
1003年工业计划

[zh.FOCUS_C08_INDUSTRIAL_PLAN_1003_desc]
我们现在有什么呢？每天被袭扰的工厂，严重短缺的军用物资，还有贫瘠的资源...\n\n这可不行，在这样的条件下，还谈什么解放呢？经济部长糖蓓儿将制定工业计划，拯救我们难以为继的工业。

